 country hick, even considering moving back to Texas. Being trained as a samurai, she has a great love and respect for the Japanese culture and would love to travel to Japan herself someday."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16594"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0be3639e6bafe153b0177f970837ecc6edd8faea37090cceb6a6b75c7aa027b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3176e81a7639ec75f86bd7636880d64ff46f3e69357a41c6c3c594ceb14b5c0.webp","width":239,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 沙苗","creatorId":"vndb:s479","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s479","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s479","name":"小林 沙苗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25341","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c86371","characterName":"フワニータ・カッシング","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c86371"},"originalCharacterName":"フワニータ・カッシング","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/6017a57d773830211245bbe4e722280c0f13f8b0e13a4e4e8f9d5d198f882cab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5cd340e47fc6431e459375d98947ba6f9597175166ad038a86ac49daa3604df.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大谷 育江","creatorId":"vndb:s1320","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1320","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1320","name":"大谷育江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25342","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c863